# smi-xsp-java

Maven artifact **`au.gov.nehta:smi-xsp`** - Java classes for XML Secured Payload Profiles. **Not** facade clients or HI/MHR services.

## Documentation

Follow **`documentation-standards.mdc`**. Integrator docs use **version numbers** - not Git branch names.

The **first number** of the Maven version is the **Java SE** target.

| Version    | Java | XML stack                          |
| ---------- | ---- | ---------------------------------- |
| **8.0.0**  | 8    | **javax** / Apache Santuario 2.3.x |
| **11.0.0** | 11   | Apache Santuario 4.0.4             |
| **17.0.0** | 17   | Apache Santuario 4.0.4             |
| **21.0.0** | 21   | Apache Santuario 4.0.4             |
| **24.0.0** | 24   | Apache Santuario 4.0.4             |

